%% Landing Zone Integration Diagram
graph LR
    subgraph LZState["Landing Zone Terraform State (S3, us-east-1)"]
        TFSTATE[(landing-zone/&lt;env&gt;/terraform.tfstate)]
    end

    subgraph ThisRepo["This Repository"]
        LZDATA["modules/landingzone-data\n(sole remote-state reader)"]
        LOCALS["Root locals.tf: local.lz.*"]
        MODS["All other modules\n(api-gateway, eventbridge, sqs, sns,\nlambda, dynamodb, security,\nmonitoring, ai-integration, disaster-recovery)"]
    end

    TFSTATE -->|terraform_remote_state data source| LZDATA
    LZDATA -->|normalized outputs| LOCALS
    LOCALS -->|explicit input variables only| MODS

    MODS -.NEVER reads terraform_remote_state directly.-> TFSTATE
